!/.agents/tasks/
!/.agents/tasks/**
/.agents/tasks/**/benchmarks/results/*.json
.playwright-cli/
# 外部工具产生的调试 trace（与运行时 .nbook/agent/traces 无关）
.traces/
/workspace/
/logs/
/coverage/
**/AGENTS.LOCAL.md
/.worktree/
vitepress/.vitepress/dist
vitepress/.vitepress/cache
assets/workspace/.nbook/agent/profiles/.compiled/
assets/workspace/.nbook/agent/variables/.compiled/
# Profile / Variable 编译的 staging 中间产物：进程崩溃时会残留，永远不进 git
assets/workspace/.nbook/agent/.staging/
assets/workspace/.nbook/agent/profiles/.system-profile-metadata.json
# 本地 Writer 文风、写作参考与旧致谢来源含个人或第三方素材，不进入公开仓库和 Product source snapshot
/assets/workspace/.nbook/agent/writing-presets/references/
/assets/workspace/.nbook/agent/writing-presets/styles/
/ACKNOWLEDGEMENTS.md
# llmlint 评测 harness（消费侧代码）：本地运行，不进 git
assets/workspace/.nbook/agent/skills/llmlint/evals/
# AIGC 检测 reference 语料统一迁入用户本地资产，不进入 Git
server/agent/variables/generated-profile-variable-types.d.ts
# 基准测试的原始结果：带本机 CPU 型号、内存、OS build 和绝对路径，只保留同目录 .md 摘要
**/benchmarks/results/*.json
# Crash dumps
*.stackdump
# Test output
test-results/
# Agent session / workspace runtime data (server-side)
server/workspace/.nbook/
server/.agent/
